    <!-- Firmware over Bluetooth -->
    <string name="firmware_intro">Open Settings &gt; Receive on the Knob, then send a signed firmware file. Sending takes a few minutes; keep the phone near the Knob and this page open. The Knob checks the signature, switches to the new firmware and restarts. Until then it keeps the firmware it runs, so a broken transfer changes nothing.</string>
